        "text": "# Schema\n\nA **schema** is a clear, repeatable plan for how each item in a dataset is structured.\n\nIt usually includes:\n\n- The **field names** (like `studentName`, `assignment`, `pointsEarned`)\n- The **data type** for each field (text/string, number, date, boolean, etc.)",
